<title>USA: Intermet Q1 net climbs on record sales.</title>
<headline>Intermet Q1 net climbs on record sales.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermet Corp said Thursday its earnings and sales rose to record levels in the first quarter.</p>
<p>The iron and aluminum castings maker said the sales gain was primarily the result of its acquisition of Sudbury Inc in January.</p>
<p>Intermet shares were up 1/4 at 13-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
